@@ -25,10 +25,10 @@ This is a single-kanji word. The character [升](../kanji/升.md) is read ます
 
 ## Synonyms and antonyms
 
-[箱](箱.md) (はこ) is a box in general; a 升 is a box used for measuring. [容器](容器.md) (ようき) is any container.
+[箱](箱.md) (はこ) is a box in general; a 升 is a box used for measuring. [容器](容器.md) (ようき) is any container. [腰掛け](腰掛け.md) (こしかけ) is a seat or bench (JMdict entry 1288370); in its second sense, 升 is a whole box of seating, such as a 升席, not a single seat or bench.
 
 ## Distinctive meaning
 
 Read しょう, the same character is the volume unit shō, about 1.8 litres (JMdict entry 2248100). JMdict also lists 枡 and 桝 as spellings of ます.
 
